 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-*   **Inputs:** A set of $N$ unposed images $\{I_i\}_{i=1}^N$ with known intrinsics (focal length $f$, resolution $W \times H$) and unknown poses. Ground-truth colors $C(r)$ and optionally deep feature maps $F(r)$ [S1, unofficial].
