 *   **Outputs:** Optimized NeRF parameters $\Theta$ (shared MLP weights), optimized camera poses $P = \{p_i\}_{i=1}^N$, and candidate embeddings $L = \{\ell_i\}_{i=1}^N$ [S1, unofficial].
 
 **Data Structures:**
