 2.  **Candidate Head MLP:** Network $\Pi_{\theta_3}$ mapping intermediate feature $z$ and candidate embedding $\ell_i$ to candidate density $\sigma_i^{(c)}$ and candidate color $c_i^{(c)}$ [S1, unofficial].
